OL,3,ADave Bautista confirmed as new God of
OL,4,AWar star
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Dave Bautista has been cast in
OL,7,Fthe lead role of the upcoming God of
OL,8,FWar TV show.
OL,10,FThe ex-WWE star will play Kratos in the
OL,11,Fadaptation of the PlayStation video
OL,12,Fgame series, after Ryan Hurst was
OL,13,Fforced to quit the part due to injury.
OL,15,FBautista, who had been rumoured to be
OL,16,Fin line to take the part for weeks,
OL,17,Fconfirmed the casting by posting an
OL,18,Fimage of the character to his Instagram
OL,19,Faccount.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
